Yes. For **AxonTimeHR**, after Phase 7 (Payroll, Salary & Compensation), I recommend **Phase 8 = Expense, Reimbursement, Loan, Advance & Financial Employee Services**.

This phase should integrate tightly with Payroll rather than creating another isolated financial system.

Below is a detailed **copy-paste prompt** for your AI coding agent.

# PHASE 8 — EXPENSE, REIMBURSEMENT, LOAN & ADVANCE MANAGEMENT

# AXONTIMEHR — PRODUCTION-GRADE EMPLOYEE FINANCIAL SERVICES

You are continuing development of **AxonTimeHR**, a modern, advanced, production-ready, multi-tenant **Attendance + HRMS SaaS platform**.

This is NOT a new project.

You must inspect the existing AxonTimeHR codebase and extend the architecture developed in Phases 1–7.

---

# 1. PHASE HISTORY

The platform has been developed incrementally:

```text
PHASE 1
Foundation
```

```text
PHASE 2
Authentication + Identity + RBAC
```

```text
PHASE 3
Organization + Employee Management
```

```text
PHASE 4
Attendance + Shift Management
```

```text
PHASE 5
GPS + Geofencing + Verified Attendance
```

```text
PHASE 6
Leave + Holiday + Regularization + Approval Workflow
```

```text
PHASE 7
Payroll + Salary + Compensation Management
```

Now implement:

```text
PHASE 8
Expense + Reimbursement + Loan + Salary Advance Management
```

