# 2. PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Build a complete employee financial-services module that supports:

```text
Employee Expenses
Travel Expenses
Expense Claims
Expense Categories
Expense Policies
Receipt Upload
Expense Approval
Expense Reimbursement
Reimbursement Processing
Employee Loans
Salary Advances
Loan Repayment
Advance Recovery
Financial Adjustments
Payroll Integration
Reports
Audit
Notifications
```

The module must be:

```text
Multi-tenant
Secure
Configurable
Auditable
Scalable
Transaction-safe
RBAC-controlled
Payroll-integrated
Extensible
Production-ready
```

---

