# 4. ARCHITECTURAL PRINCIPLE

Do NOT create separate approval engines.

Use the existing reusable workflow engine from Phase 6.

The architecture should be:

```text
Employee
    |
    +---- Expense
    |
    +---- Reimbursement
    |
    +---- Loan
    |
    +---- Salary Advance
              |
              ↓
        Approval Workflow
              |
              ↓
       Financial Processing
              |
              ↓
           Payroll
              |
              ↓
        Financial History
```

