# 126. FINANCIAL RECONCILIATION

Implement reconciliation checks:

```text
Approved Expense
        ↓
Reimbursement
        ↓
Payroll
```

and:

```text
Loan Schedule
        ↓
Payroll Deduction
        ↓
Loan Balance
```

and:

```text
Advance Schedule
        ↓
Payroll Recovery
        ↓
Advance Balance
```

Balances must reconcile exactly.

---

# 127. BALANCE VALIDATION

For every loan:

```text
Original Amount
-
Principal Recovered
=
Outstanding Principal
```

For every advance:

```text
Approved Advance
-
Recovered Amount
=
Outstanding Advance
```

Use Decimal.

---

